\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab At the end of the session, the students should be able to:\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 1. Define syntax of array\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab 2. Define two types of array\par
