\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Implicit Array Sizing and Initialization\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab An array can be initialized when declared\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Example:\par
\pard\li360\sb60\sa140\f1\fs22\cf5 {\cf5 This}{\cf5  }{\cf5 array}{\cf5  }{\cf2 is}{\cf5  }{\cf5 implicitly}{\cf5  }{\cf5 sized}\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Upper subscript value is left blank\par
\pard\tx360\li360\fi-360\sa80\f0\fs26\cf1 \u8226?\tab Number of elements implied from initialization\par
